PACKAGE NAME:     x_s3
COMPRESSED PACKAGE SIZE:     561 K
UNCOMPRESSED PACKAGE SIZE:     1280 K
PACKAGE LOCATION: diskx3
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
x_s3:     An accelerated server for cards using S3 chips.
x_s3:
x_s3:     The current S3 Server supports all available S3 chipsets: 911, 924,
x_s3:     801/805, 928, 864, and 964.  However, this does not mean that all S3
x_s3:     boards will work -- see the XFree86 docs for complete information.
x_s3:     Installing this package will create a link in /usr/X11/bin from
x_s3:     XF86_S3 to X, setting this server as the default.
x_s3:
